    <mods:note>Coloured pencil sketch for stained glass window at the chapel of Saint Mary’s Dominican convent in Dun Laoghaire, Co. Dublin, featuring Saint Agnes of Montepulciano with Dominican symbols: a dog carrying a torch, and a ship. Materials/ Technique: Coloured pencil on tracing paper. Relation: See DRIS Document Number MS11182-1354_design 1354r.</mods:note>
